| Oct 5 | Sprint 5, Sprint 6 | Izzy |  |\n| Wishlist | Wishlist page in My Account, wishlist product card, empty state | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Sep 26 | Oct 5 | Sprint 5, Sprint 6 | Jas |  |\n| Returns & refunds | Returns flow in My Account, return method selection, refund status | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Sep 26 | Oct 5 | Sprint 6 | Jas |  |\n| Order management | Order confirmation page, My Orders list, order detail & tracking | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Sep 26 | Oct 5 | Sprint 6 | Jas |  |\n| Customer account & CRM | Login & registration, My Account dashboard, profile & preferences, saved addresses | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Sep 26 | Oct 5 | Sprint 5, Sprint 6 | Miraal |  |\n| Store locator | Map & list view, store detail panel, search by location, opening hours | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Sep 26 | Oct 5 | Sprint 4, Sprint 5, Sprint 6 | ~~Izzy~~  Bianca |  |\n| Inventory | *No design required* | *Not required* | Oct 10 | Oct 19 | Sprint 7 | ~~Izzy~~ Jas | — |\n| Credit notes & gift cards | Gift card entry, credit note display in account, redemption at checkout | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Oct 24 | Nov 2 | Sprint 7, Sprint 8 | Izzy |  |\n| ZIMMmerse | Immersive editorial template, rich media modules, shop-the-look | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Oct 24 | Nov 2 | Sprint 7, Sprint 8 | ~~Izzy~~  Bianca |  |\n| Client services (TBC) | Customer service chat widget (Scope TBC — SFCC or in-chat) | Sep 21 (Sprint 5) | Oct 24 | Nov 2 | Sprint 7, Sprint 8 | ~~Izzy~~  Bianca |  |\n| SEO, analytics & AB testing | *No design required* | *Not required* | — | Nov 2 | Sprint 7, Sprint 8 | — | — |\n| NFRs & observability | *No design required* | *Not required* | — | Nov 2 | Sprint 7, Sprint 8 | — | — |\n| User mgmt & reporting – pt.2 | *No design required* | *Not required* | Oct 24 | Nov 2 | Sprint 7, Sprint 8 | Jas | — |",
